  "query_preview": "..\n(Monday Night through next Sunday)\nIssued at 1041 AM CDT Sun Aug 30 2026\n\nThe ridge continues to build during the midweek period with \nafternoon heat indices creeping up to around 105 by Tuesday and \ncontinuing in the 100-107 range through Friday. Relief overnight \nwill be limited with lows in the low to mid 70s. Rain chances will\ncontinue to be minimal through Wednesday. The ridge will start to\nlose some strength on Thursday which may allow for a couple of \nisolated storms. Models continue to indicate that the upper ridge \nwill shift westward next weekend allowing for temperatures to fall\nback closer to normal for Middle Tennessee along with some \nisolated afternoon storms.",
